    prompt: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xE0 Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 4 n\xEAu l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o?"
    explanation: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 4 n\xEAu Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc Vi\u1EC7t Nam D\xE2n ch\u1EE7 C\u1ED9ng h\xF2a l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a nh\xE2n d\xE2n, do nh\xE2n d\xE2n, v\xEC nh\xE2n d\xE2n."
    promptVN: "Nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xE0 Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 4 n\xEAu l\xE0 nh\xE0 n\u01B0\u1EDBc nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF n\xE0o?"
